# 5. What is meant by the terms instance variable and instance method?

### Instance Variable

A variable declared inside a class but outside methods.

Example

```java
class Student {
    String name;
}
```

### Instance Method

A method that operates on instance variables.

```java
class Student {
    String name;

    void display() {
        System.out.println(name);
    }
}
```

