# 11. When do we declare a method or class as final? Explain with example.

### Final Class

Cannot be inherited.

```java
final class Animal {

}
```

### Final Method

Cannot be overridden.

```java
class Animal {
    final void sound() {
        System.out.println("Animal");
    }
}
```

