# 12. What is the advantage of using "this" keyword? Explain.

`this` refers to the current object.

Uses:

* Resolve variable ambiguity
* Invoke current constructor
* Pass current object

Example

```java
class Student {
    int id;

    Student(int id) {
        this.id = id;
    }
}
```

`this.id` refers to the instance variable.

